WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.961
Forty tabs.

00:00:03.961 --> 00:00:06.406
A spreadsheet nobody trusts.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:09.375
Which job was I going to apply to?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.345
Start on Today.

00:00:14.345 --> 00:00:18.850
It opens on your own filters, and the best fits come first.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.080
Open Details to see why a job scored what it did.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.135
Press Queue on the ones worth applying to.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.461
Apply on the company's own site.

00:00:45.461 --> 00:00:47.155
Then press I applied.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:54.855
Every application keeps its stage, its next step, and when to follow up.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.710
Before a call, open the prep sheet.
